<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI Video Studio - AI Video Generator</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        textarea {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100px;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #475569;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 16px;
            resize: none;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #38bdf8;
        }
        .btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #2563eb);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            width: 100%;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>✨ AI Video Studio</h1>
        <p>Apna text prompt likhein aur AI ki madad se behtareen video generate karein!</p>
        
        <textarea placeholder="Yahan likhein aap ko kesi video chahiye (e.g., A cinematic drone shot of a futuristic city)..."></textarea>
        
        <button class="btn" onclick="alert('AI Video Generation is starting! (Yeh aapke dosto ko boht pasand ayega 🚀)')">Generate Video 🎬</button>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Created by Hasnain | Learning in Public</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
